{{!
    @template mod_onelife/picker

    Scope picker page for a One Life activity.

    Renders only what the renderable hands it: the heading, any warnings, and either
    the picker form or an explanation of why there is nothing to play.

    The mode and topic controls are rendered by formslib and passed in as formhtml.
    They are deliberately not rebuilt here, so there is one source of truth for what
    a learner may choose and it is the one that posts.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name string The activity name, already formatted
    * hasbank boolean Whether a topic bank was resolved
    * hasnotice boolean Whether to show the explanatory notice instead of the form
    * notice string The notice text
    * formhtml string The rendered picker form, empty when not playable
    * topiccount number How many topics the bank offers
    * haswarnings boolean Whether there are warnings to show
    * warnings array List of warnings
      * message string The warning text
    * hasrecords boolean Whether the viewer has any personal records yet
    * records array The viewer's personal bests, best scope first
      * scope string The scope, named the way the picker names it
      * beststreak number The best streak in that scope
      * laststreak number The streak in the most recent run
      * lasttime string When the most recent run finished
      * totalruns number How many runs in that scope

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "Revision Sprint",
        "hasbank": true,
        "hasnotice": false,
        "notice": "",
        "formhtml": "<form><p>Picker form goes here.</p></form>",
        "topiccount": 2,
        "haswarnings": true,
        "warnings": [
            {"message": "The configured topic bank is no longer usable."}
        ],
        "hasrecords": true,
        "records": [
            {
                "scope": "All topics",
                "beststreak": 12,
                "laststreak": 4,
                "lasttime": "6/09/26",
                "totalruns": 7
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="onelife-picker">

    <h2 class="onelife-picker__title">{{name}}</h2>

    {{#haswarnings}}
        <div class="onelife-picker__warnings" role="status">
            {{#warnings}}
                <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">{{message}}</div>
            {{/warnings}}
        </div>
    {{/haswarnings}}

    {{#hasnotice}}
        <div class="onelife-picker__notice alert alert-info" role="alert">{{notice}}</div>
    {{/hasnotice}}

    {{^hasnotice}}
        <div class="onelife-picker__form">
            {{{formhtml}}}
        </div>
    {{/hasnotice}}

    <section class="onelife-records">
        <h3 class="onelife-records__heading">{{#str}} personalrecords, mod_onelife {{/str}}</h3>

        {{^hasrecords}}
            <p class="onelife-records__none">{{#str}} norecordsyet, mod_onelife {{/str}}</p>
        {{/hasrecords}}

        {{#hasrecords}}
            <table class="table table-sm onelife-records__table">
                <caption class="sr-only visually-hidden">{{#str}} personalrecords, mod_onelife {{/str}}</caption>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}} recordscope, mod_onelife {{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}} recordbest, mod_onelife {{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}} recordlast, mod_onelife {{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}} recordruns, mod_onelife {{/str}}</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#records}}
                        <tr>
                            <th scope="row" class="onelife-records__scope">{{scope}}</th>
                            <td class="onelife-records__best">{{beststreak}}</td>
                            <td class="onelife-records__last">{{laststreak}} <small>{{lasttime}}</small></td>
                            <td class="onelife-records__runs">{{totalruns}}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{/records}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        {{/hasrecords}}
    </section>

</div>
